---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro'
import { pages } from '../config/seo'
import { site } from '../config/site'
---

<LegalLayout meta={pages.privacy} title="Privacy Policy" updated="25 November 2026">
  <p>
    This policy explains how {site.legalName} ("we", "us") handles information when you use this website.
  </p>
  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <p>
    When you send an enquiry through the form on this website, we store the details you enter: your name, phone number, what you
    are interested in, your message (if any), your consent and the date and time of the enquiry. The form then opens WhatsApp so you
    can send us the same details as a message. Nothing is sent to WhatsApp until you choose to send that message yourself.
  </p>
  <p>We do not ask for, or store, passwords, payment details or identity documents through this website.</p>
  <h2>Why we use it</h2>
  <p>
    We use your enquiry only to contact you about membership, your visit or the programme you asked about, and to keep track of
    whether we have replied. We do not sell your details, share them with advertisers or add you to marketing lists. The legal basis
    is the consent you give by ticking the box on the form.
  </p>
  <h2>Where it is stored and who can see it</h2>
  <p>
    Enquiries are stored securely with our database provider, Supabase, on servers in Mumbai, India. Only the gym owner can sign in
    to view them; website visitors cannot read any stored enquiry.
  </p>
  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>
    We keep an enquiry for up to 12 months after our last contact with you, then delete it. If you become a member, we keep only what
    we need to manage your membership.
  </p>
  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>
    You can ask us at any time to see, correct or delete the details you sent us, or to stop contacting you. Use the contact details
    below and we will act on your request within 30 days.
  </p>
  <h2>Third-party services</h2>
  <p>
    This site loads images from Unsplash, displays an embedded Google Map, shows cover images of our Instagram posts (stored on this website, so Instagram isn't contacted until you tap a post), and links to Instagram and WhatsApp. These services
    may collect technical data (such as your IP address) under their own privacy policies.
  </p>
  <h2>Analytics</h2>
  <p>If analytics are added in future, this section will describe what is measured and how to opt out.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    For any privacy question, call us on{' '}
    <a class="text-brand-300 underline" href={`tel:${site.contact.phone}`}>{site.contact.phoneDisplay}</a> or message us on Instagram at{' '}
    <a class="text-brand-300 underline" href={site.social.instagramUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@{site.social.instagramHandle}</a>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
